From 92cfdfd7410e0220898448ba55e86e1ea859aad0 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Siddharth Chauhan <officialsiddharthchauhan@gmail.com>
Date: Sat, 8 Nov 2025 00:31:53 +0530
Subject: [PATCH 1/2] feat: Add Image Loader with OCR support for multiple
 providers (#5195)

- Add Image Loader node with support for Unstructured, AWS Textract, and Google Vision OCR providers
- Implement OCR provider abstraction interface for extensibility
- Add Google Vision API credential configuration
- Update AWS credential to include region field
- Add image file type mappings (.jpg, .jpeg, .png, .gif, .bmp, .webp, .tiff, .tif)
- Update dropdown components to render HTML links in descriptions
- Support theme-aware link styling in dropdown options

This implementation addresses issue #5195 by enabling image uploads in Document Store
with OCR text extraction, chunk preview, and support for multiple OCR service providers.
